  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowerment for Equality(E4E) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This a gender justice project for Malawi that aims to promote gender equality and challenge unequal power structures, support marginalized communities and ensure inclusive participation and addressing inequalities and structural causes of gender injustice. The project seek to achieve the following results; women and girls have increased capacities to exercise leadership in efforts to end violence against women and girls (e.g. as agents of change, human rights defenders, community leaders, etc taking an active role in ending violence against gender-based violence etc) &#xa0;Social norms, behaviors, attitudes and practices in the community are transformed or improved to better protect women and girls from violence and improved essential service provision for survivors for survivors and women and girls at risk of violence (e.g health, social, justice services.</narrative>
  </description>
